{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b","title":"曹仁遣常雕曹泰攻朱桓严圭破军魏退","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"曹仁遣常雕曹泰攻朱桓严圭破军魏退","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"id":"yululu-a-2d3c4a6829607717a85f","label":"正文","text":"黄武初曹仁攻濡须，使别将常雕等袭中洲","evidence":["yululu-q-12e54bb28545c8b8ae82"]},{"id":"yululu-a-34c7a08a16596469b9df","label":"正文","text":"骆统与严圭共拒破常雕等，统封新阳亭侯","evidence":["yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-ren","role":"遣军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0038","role":"进攻","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0039","role":"进攻","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0028","role":"拒守","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0040","role":"破军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0026","role":"拒战受封","evidence":["yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":223,"label":"黄武二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y223","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o063","basis":"黄武二年"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o063b-q","wuzhu-q-o063","zhuge-q-o021","wendi-q-o038","wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o063b-q","source_order":[47,355,"O063b"],"order":8246}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0040","name":"严圭","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o063","yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648","yululu-q-fe7f57396c167ec96848"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-o063-wuzhu-p0040","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o063"]},{"id":"yululu-m-14289ae3173d6a1ff328","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及严圭，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-fe7f57396c167ec96848"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：黄初四年（公元 223）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2950ca88709b8c25fb44","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o038","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-62c39b4b73d5f8874468","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“丧乱以来，兵革未戢〖2〗。天下之人，互相残杀。今海内初定，敢有私复仇者，皆族之〖3〗！”筑南巡台于宛。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-81e074e42b79f01d129f","layer":"original","quote":"三月，曹仁遣将军常雕等，以兵五千，乘油船〖6〗，晨渡濡须中州；仁子泰，因引军急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之；遣将军严圭等击破雕等。是月，魏军皆退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":122},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o063","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-81e074e42b79f01d129f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，曹真分军据江陵中州〖2〗。是月，城江夏山〖3〗。改《四分》〖4〗，用《乾象历》〖5〗。﹝一﹞三月，曹仁遣将军常雕等，以兵五千，乘油船〖6〗，晨渡濡须中州；仁子泰，因引军急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之；遣将军严圭等击破雕等。是月，魏军皆退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122},{"id":"yululu-q-12e54bb28545c8b8ae82","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"黄武初，曹仁攻濡须，使别将常雕等袭中洲","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":35},{"id":"yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"统与严圭共拒破之，封新阳亭侯","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":36,"end":50},{"id":"yululu-q-fe7f57396c167ec96848","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"以随陆逊破蜀军于宜都，迁偏将军。黄武初，曹仁攻濡须，使别将常雕等袭中洲；统与严圭共拒破之，封新阳亭侯。后为濡须督。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"zhuge-q-o021","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-6f9ad1f5d575a9d3f55f","layer":"original","quote":"章武三年春，先主于永安病笃〖1〗；召亮于成都，属以后事。谓亮曰：“君才十倍曹丕，必能安国，终定大事。若嗣子可辅，辅之；如其不才〖2〗，君可自取〖3〗。”亮涕泣曰：“臣敢竭股肱之力〖4〗，效忠贞之节，继之以死！”先主又为诏敕后主曰：“汝与丞相从事〖5〗，事之如父。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
